# Netlify Redirects Configuration for Marvi Mart

# 1. Seamlessly map any legacy or cached /src/assets/images/* paths to /images/*
/src/assets/images/*  /images/:splat  200

# 2. Allow direct access to uploaded product images if present
/uploads/*  /uploads/:splat  200

# 3. Optional Backend API Proxy:
# If you host your Express backend (server.ts) on Render, Railway, Fly.io, Cloud Run, or VPS,
# uncomment and set your backend URL below to proxy /api/* requests:
# /api/*  https://YOUR_BACKEND_URL/api/:splat  200!

# 4. Prevent API endpoints from falling through to the SPA index.html
# Returns a clean 404 for unproxied API calls rather than returning 200 with index.html
/api/*  /404  404

# 5. Single Page App (SPA) fallback to index.html for all client-side browser routes
/*  /index.html  200
